  "description": "In the cutthroat world of showbiz, reclusive actor Ji-Han is forced by his struggling agency into a secretive hotel meeting with a powerful investor. What should be a business deal instantly devolves into a volatile power struggle when Ji-Han is trapped in an intense first meeting with Seo-Joon, who seemingly has no qualms in overstepping boundaries. Over multiple encounters, Seo-Joon pushes to assert dominance that Ji-Han fiercely resists, which only fuels Seo-Joon’s obsession. As the toxic friction between them grows, so does a different emotion that neither of them are ready for…\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
